Read four raw count tables (reference: SRR5085167, SRR5085168; changed: SRR5085169, SRR5085170).
Input genes: 7127.
Filter: retain genes with >= 10 raw counts in at least two of four samples.
Retained genes tested: 2526.
Method: DESeq2 (PyDESeq2), design ~condition, contrast changed vs reference.
Results: unshrunken log2 fold change, Wald p-value, BH FDR across retained genes.
Output: final_answer/differential_expression.tsv and final_answer/method.json.
